.120" end="00:09.910"> it's</span><span begin="00:10.000" end="00:11.260"> almost</span><span begin="00:11.440" end="00:12.790"> over</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.790" end="00:15.300"><span begin="00:12.790" end="00:12.930">I</span><span begin="00:13.070" end="00:13.480"> guess</span><span begin="00:13.620" end="00:13.720"> I</span><span begin="00:13.760" end="00:14.270"> should've</span><span begin="00:14.320" end="00:15.300"> known</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.300" end="00:18.220"><span begin="00:15.300" end="00:15.390">I</span><span begin="00:15.480" end="00:15.570"> guess</span><span begin="00:15.600" end="00:15.620"> a</span><span begin="00:15.740" end="00:15.850"> part</span><span begin="00:15.970" end="00:16.090"> of</span><span begin="00:16.220" end="00:16.270"> me</span><span begin="00:16.320" end="00:16.640"> still</span><span begin="00:16.780" end="00:18.220"> hoped</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.220" end="00:23.840"><span begin="00:18.220" end="00:18.450">Broken</span><span begin="00:18.500" end="00:18.870"> from</span><span begin="00:19.060" end="00:19.430"> the</span><span begin="00:19.480" end="00:20.360"> start</span><span begin="00:20.590" end="00:21.840"> (the</span><span begin="00:22.170" end="00:22.680"> beat</span><span begin="00:22.820" end="00:22.960"> in</span><span begin="00:23.010" end="00:23.050"> my</span><span begin="00:23.100" end="00:23.140"> chest</span><span begin="00:23.190" end="00:23.240"> sounds</span><span begin="00:23.250" end="00:23.260"> like</span><span begin="00:23.260" end="00:23.270"> a</span><span begin="00:23.280" end="00:23.280"> swan</span><span begin="00:23.280" end="00:23.840"> song)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.840" end="00:29.170"><span begin="00:23.840" end="00:23.930">You</span><span begin="00:24.070" end="00:24.210"> got</span><span begin="00:24.260" end="00:24.290"> a</span><span begin="00:24.320" end="00:24.350"> bullet</span><span begin="00:24.400" end="00:24.540