.550"><span begin="01:06.230" end="01:06.460">Hold</span><span begin="01:06.510" end="01:06.790"> on</span><span begin="01:06.830" end="01:06.970"> to</span><span begin="01:07.020" end="01:07.530"> your</span><span begin="01:07.620" end="01:08.550"> heart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.550" end="01:13.380"><span begin="01:08.550" end="01:08.640">It's</span><span begin="01:08.690" end="01:09.340"> almost</span><span begin="01:09.530" end="01:10.360"> over</span><span begin="01:10.590" end="01:11.060"> (my</span><span begin="01:11.110" end="01:11.240"> soul's</span><span begin="01:11.340" end="01:12.170"> collateral</span><span begin="01:12.270" end="01:12.450"> to</span><span begin="01:12.500" end="01:13.380"> you)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.380" end="01:15.330"><span begin="01:13.380" end="01:13.430">I</span><span begin="01:13.470" end="01:13.890"> guess</span><span begin="01:13.980" end="01:14.030"> I</span><span begin="01:14.080" end="01:14.680"> should've</span><span begin="01:14.730" end="01:15.330"> known</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.330" end="01:17.190"><span begin="01:15.330" end="01:15.350">I</span><span begin="01:15.360" end="01:15.380"> guess</span><span begin="01:15.420" end="01:15.470"> a</span><span begin="01:15.520" end="01:15.980"> part</span><span begin="01:16.030" end="01:16.120"> of</span><span begin="01:16.170" end="01:16.310"> me</span><span begin="01:16.490" end="01:16.680"> still</span><span begin="01:16.720" end="01:17.220"> hoped</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.190" end="01:22.760"><span begin="01:17.190" end="01:17.240">Broken</span><span begin="01:17.260" end="01:17.280"> from</span><span begin="01:17.350" end="01:17.420"> the</span><span begin="01:17.470" end="01:17.880"> start</span><span begin="01:17.980" end="01:18.580"> (the</span><span begin="01:18.910" end="01:19.650"> beat</span><span begin="01:19.740" end="01:20.020"> in</span><span begin="01:20.070" end="01:20.300"> my</span><span begin